{"symbol":"MDG.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:53:13Z","info":{"address1":"Central Tower Building","address2":"19. pietro Al. Jerozolimskie 81","city":"Warsaw","zip":"02-001","country":"Poland","phone":"48 22 825 1249","website":"https://www.medicalgorithmics.pl","industry":"Medical Devices","industryKey":"medical-devices","industryDisp":"Medical Devices","sector":"Healthcare","sectorKey":"healthcare","sectorDisp":"Healthcare","longBusinessSummary":"Medicalgorithmics S.A. provides AI-powered and noninvasive solutions for cardiac diagnostic in Poland, the United States, and internationally. It offers PocketECG, an AI-driven online ECG monitoring device for long-term holter, cardiac event, and mobile cardiac telemetry analysis; Kardiobeat.ai, an AI-Driven lightweight wireless holter monitor; DeepRhythmAI, a hardware-agnostic cloud-based software that leverages cutting-edge AI technology to detect, classify, analyze, and report ECG data; and DeepRhythmAI, a set of algorithms for heart rhythm analysis that integrates into third-party software and devices. The company also provides virtual cardiac stress test (VCAST), an AI-based medical system developed for non-invasive, clinical quantitative, and qualitative analysis of CT-scan data, to assess the hemodynamic significance of coronary artery atherosclerotic stenosis. In addition, the company engages in research and development services, including algorithm development, clinical studies, software development, consulting services, and medical hardware development; and end-to-end ECG Monitoring for clinical trials. Medicalgorithmics S.A. company was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":109,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Krzysztof  Siemionow M.D., Ph.D.","title":"President of the Management Board & CEO","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Michal  Zapora","title":"CFO & Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexer